  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Elegant Dark\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Elegant Dark\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"bg-neutral-950 text-neutral-100 font-sans w-[1024px] h-[768px] flex overflow-hidden border border-neutral-800\\\">\\n  <!-- Sidebar -->\\n  <aside class=\\\"w-64 border-r border-neutral-800 flex flex-col bg-neutral-900/50\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"p-6 flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-orange-600 rounded flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white\\\">E3</div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"font-bold tracking-tight text-xl\\\">ELMANEKO <span class=\\\"text-orange-500\\\">3D</span></h1>\\n    </div>\\n    \\n    <nav class=\\\"flex-1 px-4 space-y-1\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-500 border border-orange-500/20\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M4 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM14 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM4 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2zM14 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2z\\\"></path></svg>\\n        <span class=\\\"font-medium\\\">Dashboard</span>\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors text-neutral-400\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4\\\"></path></svg>\\n        <span>Filamentos</span>\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors text-neutral-400\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M9 3v2m6-2v2M9 19v2m6-2v2M5 9H3m2 6H3m18-6h-2m2 6h-2M7 19h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2zM9 9h6v6H9V9z\\\"></path></svg>\\n        <span>Impressoras</span>\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors text-neutral-400\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z\\\"></path></svg>\\n        <span>Produ\303\247\303\243o</span>\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors text-neutral-400\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z\\\"></path></svg>\\n        <span>Or\303\247amentos</span>\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors text-neutral-400\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M12 8v13m0-13V6a2 2 0 112 2h-2zm0 0V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 109.5 8H12zm-7 4h14M5 12a2 2 0 110-4h14a2 2 0 110 4M5 12v7a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-7\\\"></path></svg>\\n        <span>Vendas</span>\\n      </a>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"p-4 border-t border-neutral-800\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-neutral-800 p-3 rounded-xl\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-neutral-600\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs font-semibold\\\">Admin Elmaneko</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500 truncate\\\">admin@elmaneko.com</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </aside>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Content -->\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col bg-neutral-950\\\">\\n    <header class=\\\"h-16 border-bottom border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-between px-8 bg-neutral-900/20\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-lg font-semibold\\\">Vis\303\243o Geral</h2>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-xs bg-neutral-800 text-neutral-400 px-2 py-1 rounded\\\">Julho 2024</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition-colors\\\">Nova Produ\303\247\303\243o</button>\\n        <button class=\\\"p-2 bg-neutral-800 hover:bg-neutral-700 rounded-lg\\\">\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M15 17h5l-1.405-1.405A2.032 2.032 0 0118 14.158V11a6.002 6.002 0 00-4-5.659V5a2 2 0 10-4 0v.341C7.67 6.165 6 8.388 6 11v3.159c0 .538-.214 1.055-.595 1.436L4 17h5m6 0v1a3 3 0 11-6 0v-1m6 0H9\\\"></path></svg>\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"p-8 flex-1 overflow-hidden space-y-6\\\">\\n      <!-- Top Cards -->\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-6\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 p-5 rounded-2xl\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-neutral-500 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\\\">Estoque Total</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-baseline gap-2\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold\\\">12.450</h3>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-neutral-500 text-sm\\\">g</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-green-500 text-[10px] mt-2 font-semibold\\\">+4.2% vs m\303\252s anterior</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 p-5 rounded-2xl\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-neutral-500 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\\\">Valor Estoque</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-baseline gap-2\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold\\\">R$ 2.840</h3>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-neutral-500 text-sm\\\">,00</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-neutral-500 text-[10px] mt-2 font-semibold\\\">32 Rolos Ativos</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 p-5 rounded-2xl border-l-orange-500 border-l-4\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-neutral-500 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\\\">Produ\303\247\303\265es Ativas</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-baseline gap-2\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold text-orange-500\\\">8</h3>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-neutral-500 text-sm\\\">M\303\241quinas</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-orange-400 text-[10px] mt-2 font-semibold\\\">85% de Ocupa\303\247\303\243o</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 p-5 rounded-2xl\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-neutral-500 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\\\">Faturamento</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-baseline gap-2\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold\\\">R$ 14.210</h3>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-neutral-500 text-sm\\\">,40</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-green-500 text-[10px] mt-2 font-semibold\\\">Meta 75% conclu\303\255da</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Mid Section -->\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 h-[400px]\\\">\\n        <!-- Active Print Monitoring -->\\n        <div class=\\\"col-span-2 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"px-6 py-4 border-b border-neutral-800 flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <h4 class=\\\"font-semibold text-sm\\\">Monitoramento de Produ\303\247\303\243o</h4>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs text-orange-500 cursor-pointer\\\">Ver tudo</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1 overflow-hidden p-4 space-y-3\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 bg-neutral-800/50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-neutral-700/50\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-neutral-700 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"text-orange-500 font-bold text-xs\\\">P1</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-1\\\">\\n                  <p class=\\\"text-sm font-medium\\\">Suporte Articulado V2</p>\\n                  <p class=\\\"text-xs text-neutral-400\\\">78%</p>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\\"w-full bg-neutral-700 h-1.5 rounded-full\\\">\\n                  <div class=\\\"bg-orange-500 h-full rounded-full\\\" style=\\\"width: 78%\\\"></div>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-right\\\">\\n                <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold\\\">01:24h</p>\\n                <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500\\\">restante</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 bg-neutral-800/50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-neutral-700/50\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-neutral-700 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"text-orange-500 font-bold text-xs\\\">P2</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-1\\\">\\n                  <p class=\\\"text-sm font-medium\\\">Casing Modulado (x4)</p>\\n                  <p class=\\\"text-xs text-neutral-400\\\">32%</p>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\\"w-full bg-neutral-700 h-1.5 rounded-full\\\">\\n                  <div class=\\\"bg-orange-500 h-full rounded-full\\\" style=\\\"width: 32%\\\"></div>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-right\\\">\\n                <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold\\\">08:45h</p>\\n                <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500\\\">restante</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 bg-neutral-800/50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-neutral-700/50 opacity-60\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-neutral-700 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"text-neutral-500 font-bold text-xs\\\">M1</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-1 text-neutral-400 italic\\\">\\n                  <p class=\\\"text-sm font-medium\\\">Impressora Ender 3 Pro</p>\\n                  <p class=\\\"text-xs text-red-500\\\">Manuten\303\247\303\243o</p>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\\"w-full bg-neutral-700 h-1.5 rounded-full\\\">\\n                  <div class=\\\"bg-red-500 h-full rounded-full\\\" style=\\\"width: 100%\\\"></div>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-right\\\">\\n                <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold\\\">--</p>\\n                <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500\\\">parada</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Filament Stock Alert -->\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-2xl flex flex-col\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"px-6 py-4 border-b border-neutral-800\\\">\\n            <h4 class=\\\"font-semibold text-sm\\\">N\303\255veis de Filamento</h4>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-6 space-y-5\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-xs\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"text-neutral-400\\\">PLA Silk Orange</span>\\n                <span class=\\\"font-bold text-red-400\\\">120g</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-2 bg-neutral-800 rounded-full overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"bg-red-500 h-full\\\" style=\\\"width: 12%\\\"></div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-xs\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"text-neutral-400\\\">PETG Matte Black</span>\\n                <span class=\\\"font-bold text-orange-400\\\">450g</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-2 bg-neutral-800 rounded-full overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"bg-orange-500 h-full\\\" style=\\\"width: 45%\\\"></div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-xs\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"text-neutral-400\\\">ABS Industrial Gray</span>\\n                <span class=\\\"font-bold text-green-400\\\">980g</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-2 bg-neutral-800 rounded-full overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"bg-green-500 h-full\\\" style=\\\"width: 98%\\\"></div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"mt-auto\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"w-full py-2 bg-neutral-800 hover:bg-neutral-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg border border-neutral-700 transition-all\\\">\\n                Gerenciar Pedidos de Insumos\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Footer Status Bar -->\\n      <div class=\\\"h-12 border-t border-neutral-800 mt-auto flex items-center justify-between px-2 text-[10px] text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex gap-6\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\"><span class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500\\\"></span> Supabase Online</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\"><span class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500\\\"></span> Banco PostgreSQL Ativo</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>v2.0.4-MVP &copy; 2024 Elmaneko Systems</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Elegant Dark\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Elegant Dark\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"bg-neutral-950 text-neutral-100 font-sans w-[1024px] h-[768px] flex overflow-hidden border border-neutral-800\\\">\\n  <!-- Sidebar -->\\n  <aside class=\\\"w-64 border-r border-neutral-800 flex flex-col bg-neutral-900/50\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"p-6 flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-orange-600 rounded flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white\\\">E3</div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"font-bold tracking-tight text-xl\\\">ELMANEKO <span class=\\\"text-orange-500\\\">3D</span></h1>\\n    </div>\\n    \\n    <nav class=\\\"flex-1 px-4 space-y-1\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-500 border border-orange-500/20\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M4 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM14 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM4 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2zM14 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2z\\\"></path></svg>\\n        <span class=\\\"font-medium\\\">Dashboard</span>\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors text-neutral-400\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4\\\"></path></svg>\\n        <span>Filamentos</span>\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors text-neutral-400\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M9 3v2m6-2v2M9 19v2m6-2v2M5 9H3m2 6H3m18-6h-2m2 6h-2M7 19h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2