imple and effective.\n\n\n**Updating the Footer Design**\n\nI\'m now focused on the sidebar footer. I\'m updating the `div` element to reflect the reference design, changing the classes to `\"p-4 border-t border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-900/20\"`. Then, I\'m refactoring the user info card to match the \"elegant dark\" theme, working with `neutral-800` and `neutral-900` colors. I will update the logout button as well, for a consistent look.\n\n\n**Refining the Logout Button**\n\nI\'ve just styled the logout button. The classes are now perfectly aligned: \"rounded-lg cursor-pointer transition-colors\" with a \"Encerrar Sess\303\243o\" title, just like the Design HTML! This maintains the dynamic first-letter/logout functionality! It\'s exactly the styling I wanted. I\'ve also focused on the main section layout in `App.tsx`, updating the header to reflect the \"Elegant Dark\" theme.\n\n\n"
