    modified_response: "I have successfully applied the **Elegant Dark** design theme to the Elmaneko 3D ERP application.\n\n### Summary of Improvements\n\n- **Premium Typography**: Imported and configured **Inter** for all UI element headings, tables, and actions, and **JetBrains Mono** for numerical values and technical metrics to enhance reading legibility.\n- **Unified Palette**: Upgraded the layout wrapper from black to a deep **neutral-950** background. Configured active lists and cards with **neutral-900** containers highlighted with subtle, professional **neutral-800** borders.\n- **Polished Sidebar**: Refined the brand logo to a minimalist orange badge, transformed active navigation options into semi-transparent orange buttons (`bg-orange-500/10` with soft borders), and updated the user session card at the bottom of the sidebar to fit the dark aesthetic.\n- **Seamless Integrations**: Maintained all custom features, form-handlers, and automated math engines without altering any component structure or breaking any React mechanisms. All local storage hooks and core operations are completely preserved."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
